OL,3,GNEWSA'Are you going to call your
OL,4,Adaughter Dolly?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Shane Jarman received a call two
OL,7,Fdays after the birth of his daughter
OL,8,Ftelling him to come to hospital, he
OL,9,Fnever imagined that he was about to
OL,10,Fmeet a country music icon.
OL,12,FDolly Parton, who died at the age of 80
OL,13,Fon Tuesday, visited Rotherham in South
OL,14,FYorkshire to launch her Imagination
OL,15,FLibrary in 2007.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
