OL,3,GNEWSA'Are you going to call your
OL,4,Adaughter Dolly?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project aimed to encourage children
OL,7,Funder five to read by sending them a
OL,8,Ffree book each month - and its first
OL,9,Frecipient in the UK was Shane's
OL,10,Fdaughter Emma, who received a copy of
OL,11,FBeatrix Potter's The Tale of Peter
OL,12,FRabbit.
OL,14,FShane, now 59, recalled being called by
OL,15,Fhis wife Claire while up a ladder as he
OL,16,Fdecorated a Christmas tree at the
OL,17,Fschool where he worked.
